/P 118 0 R
/E (Even though I am a New Yorker who first discovered bitcoin almost a decade ago, I have remained ignorant of the bitdev concept until very recently. From what I assumed these organizations were exclusively for developers, and any meetings open to the public would be highly technical and way over my head. Then, I was bored one day when I was in the Tampa Bay area, so I decided to attend a bitdev meetup. I posted about that experience: #1511345)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
